  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency 2007 Cyclone Recovery and Restoration Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PDO is to support the Government of Bangladesh efforts to facilitate recovery from the damage to livelihoods and infrastructure caused by Cyclone Sidr and to build long-term preparedness through strengthened disaster risk reduction and management.</narrative>
  </description>
